{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own wild garden and attract nocturnal friends!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy, tile-placing and building game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  tile-placing game about\u00a0biodiversity, moths and our nighttime ecosystem. Explore different <strong>Biomes </strong>like  moonlit meadows, sandy dunes and urban garden nightlife. Plant grasses, flowers, and ponds to create a biodiverse environment that will attract new species of moth friends to thrive. Combat urbanisation, artificial light and predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/d59368701e6376d2c154d85c4f3a8828.avif?t=1762452217\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/35b0d95101b0f5a0b7006d484321d5bf.avif?t=1762452217\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/a4d60b529c4be1e58f85acc7725830d6.avif?t=1762452217\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086570?t=1762452217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086570?t=1762452217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/433486bd7231c0ab7a4bb88c80eead9fd06d7469/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762452217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.ak